               END-SEARCH.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-BROKER-ID-0051.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         WS-KEY-POLICY    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-AGENT-CODE-0052.
